        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% USERS\n%% ==========================\n\nA[\&quot;End Users&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Customers calling AI agents&lt;br/&gt;Business users accessing dashboard\&quot;]\n\n\nB[\&quot;Internet&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;HTTPS&lt;br/&gt;WebRTC&lt;br/&gt;SIP Traffic\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% EDGE\n%% ==========================\n\nC[\&quot;Load Balancer / API Gateway&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Traffic routing&lt;br/&gt;SSL termination&lt;br/&gt;Security\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% APPLICATION\n%% ==========================\n\nD[\&quot;Next.js Frontend&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;SaaS Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;User interface\&quot;]\n\n\nE[\&quot;FastAPI Backend&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;REST APIs&lt;br/&gt;Authentication&lt;br/&gt;Business logic\&quot;]\n\n\nF[\&quot;Agent Control Plane&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Agent management&lt;br/&gt;Dispatching&lt;br/&gt;Configuration\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% VOICE\n%% ==========================\n\nG[\&quot;LiveKit Server&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Real-time audio&lt;br/&gt;Rooms&lt;br/&gt;WebRTC sessions\&quot;]\n\n\nH[\&quot;LiveKit Agent Workers&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Python services&lt;br/&gt;Voice agents&lt;br/&gt;Concurrent sessions\&quot;]\n\n\nI[\&quot;Twilio SIP&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Phone network&lt;br/&gt;Inbound / Outbound calls\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% AI\n%% ==========================\n\nJ[\&quot;LangGraph Runtime&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Agent workflows&lt;br/&gt;Tools&lt;br/&gt;Memory&lt;br/&gt;Decision making\&quot;]\n\n\nK[\&quot;AI Providers&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;LLM&lt;br/&gt;STT&lt;br/&gt;TTS&lt;br/&gt;Embeddings\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% DATA\n%% ==========================\n\nL[\&quot;PostgreSQL + pgvector&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Users&lt;br/&gt;Tenants&lt;br/&gt;Agents&lt;br/&gt;Knowledge vectors&lt;br/&gt;Logs\&quot;]\n\n\nM[\&qu